# Release the AP's vote on the modem rail (mss.lvl) once the modem is up
# (kernel patch 0044, guacamole_mss_vote).  With the vote held at the top
# corner the phone froze at the pm_test "platform" stage; with it released,
# s2idle suspend and resume work.  Automatic suspend stays disabled.
enable guacamole-mss-release.service
